<title>BELGIUM: EU raises grain import duties.</title>
<headline>EU raises grain import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union raised its import duties on high medium and low quality wheat and on maize effective on Tuesday, the European Commission said.</p>
<p>Distant high quality wheat import duties rose to 40.87 Ecus/tonne, medium quality to 40.52, and low quality to 61.11.</p>
<p>Distant maize duty rose to 80.51 Ecus/tonne.  </p>
